{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1656.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"ddcd5ce859b783eeb10f032d053eeacd07a1d73f3d0e4c16c3f39c8d3568f02f","ja":"最高の贈りもの","zh":"最好的礼物","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1656.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"bdbefe816117b5032ec8d2dabf096ac65cf2d74d46b6b5afcf08890778ef3cf0","ja":"なるほどねぇ。それでばあちゃんの\n好きなものが知りたかったんだねぇ。","zh":"原来是这样啊。所以才想知道奶奶\n喜欢什么东西呀。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1656.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"715f7d11eb186aa4581d59755198ad55c9ec2fbb383958a62fdb21701df8c39f","ja":"うん！　この前のお礼の気持ちを、\n地元のお菓子に込めて伝えたいんだ！","zh":"嗯！我想把上次的感谢之情，\n寄托在家乡的点心里传达给大家！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1656.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"7231ac102e273e0a5d67112e204c5adaef92d11afbf22c38bb831cec73de75a4","ja":"一生懸命考えてもらえて、\nばあちゃん達は幸せ者だねぇ。","zh":"能让大家这么用心为我们着想，\n老太婆我们可真是幸福呀。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1656.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"0051c6031ee1d020bb9500aa478ce1039ec98b966b19da1532d867bf519f1f73","ja":"ただ……そんなに多いと、ばあちゃん達も\n食べきれないかもしれないねぇ。","zh":"不过……要是这么多的话，奶奶她们\n可能也吃不完呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1656.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"62d11d57a94b8b2f1517dba1ed07f03efbe5cda7bfad3113ba84e1fc796e8a4a","ja":"あっ……そ、そっか！\nひなばあちゃん達、困っちゃうね！","zh":"啊……对、对哦！\n日向奶奶她们会很困扰的呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1656.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"05774e5cc3751553d402f8006b4967a805d039b41775d5e8e3a11c9997a8dcb6","ja":"す、すみません！　言われてみれば、\nたしかに量が多すぎましたね……。","zh":"对、对不起！经您这么一说，\n确实是量太多了呢……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1656.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"f32b3055e7c52221b56e458b2831b3d62b512ddc33968756acbc43c296c76e40","ja":"……あのね、可奈ちゃんと紬さんの気持ちは、\nあたしもすっごくうれしいんだ。だから……。","zh":"……那个，可奈和紬小姐的心意，\n我也非常开心。所以……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1656.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"39a01cba6ac8a9d9fa00a0a0bcb7039c047c7b3013aa3295cd56ffadacbfff0e","ja":"その気持ちは、\nお手紙にしてもらえないかい？","zh":"那份心意，\n能不能写成信交给我呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1656.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"b3119ff73f0b6dc7b482bc9c222740baf228e0d3cc7443743ea23ece0daf158b","ja":"あっ……手紙、ですか。","zh":"啊……是信，吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1656.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"bdc68328ced2a66296f925767054ce6d3a86aa74abf01fdfd3e6c1c35761701e","ja":"北海道の感想とか、ふたりの故郷のこととか\n書いてもらえたら、なまら喜んでくれると思うべさ。","zh":"要是能写写关于北海道的感想，或者她们俩故乡的事，\n我想她们一定会特别高兴的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1656.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"579a16bab4a3f94f3822ffd36387eec935bcfb90fef297949a45d108cfbd98a5","ja":"……うん！　私、いっぱい書くね！　\n北海道で楽しかったこととか、横浜のこととか！","zh":"……嗯！我会写很多的！\n像是在北海道开心的事，还有横滨的事！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1656.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"9ff1b117f8331592a80c85a8f6cf22eeb13bea7b376913a24cd9103e0bb76257","ja":"私も、感謝の気持ちをしたためます！","zh":"我也要写下我的感谢之情！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1656.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"432ba55941e3ae53ed2585b337bd84bed23ac73311b8ad3241c680c9db73e15f","ja":"ありがとねぇ。可奈ちゃんと紬さんの\nあったかい気持ち、きっとばあちゃん達に届くべさ。","zh":"谢谢你们呀。可奈和小紬的\n这份心意暖洋洋的，一定能传达给奶奶她们的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
